---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/guard-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/guard-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="The guard overruled the model about half the time"
  caption="Every likely-pass vote from the model, one square each."
>
  Unit chart of the 55 times the model voted likely pass. 28 went through with evidence behind each: 21 with a problem a script checked and 7 with two must-haves clearly missed. 27 had a vote and nothing behind it, and were held at maybe.
</Chart>
